      "id": "claim_64177132ec104074af662e1e14e4b241",
      "statement": "The corpus index chunks every document's full text with clamped overlap using the same windowing logic as judgment's sectioning, tags each chunk with its source doc_id, and embeds chunks with a lazily loaded module-cached offline model2vec static model so no network call or GPU is needed at query time.",
